<BaseLayout title="AIfred — Personal AI Assistant" description="AIfred is Tom Langer's personal AI assistant for email, calendar, and documents." noIndex>
  <h1>AIfred</h1>
  <p>AIfred is a personal AI assistant operated by Tom Langer. It helps its owner manage email, calendar events, and documents through private conversations and explicitly authorized integrations.</p>
  <h2>Google integrations</h2>
  <p>With the owner's permission, AIfred can read and summarize Gmail messages, send requested emails, review calendars, manage events on owned calendars, and work with Google Drive files created or explicitly selected for the app. Separate permissions are requested for email sending and file access. Only the permissions approved on Google's consent screen are granted.</p>
  <h2>Personal use</h2>
  <p>AIfred is a privately operated assistant, not a public sign-up service. This page describes the integration; it does not provide access to the assistant or to any Google account.</p>
  <p><a href="/aifred/privacy/">Privacy policy</a></p>
  <p>Contact: <a href="mailto:langer.tom7@gmail.com">langer.tom7@gmail.com</a></p>
</BaseLayout>

